{"id":"HAD-1261","recordType":"hadith","language":"de","narratorLine":"ʿĀʾišah رضي الله عنها berichtete:","speakerLabel":"Der Prophet ﷺ sagte:","textMarkdown":"Allah ist sanftmütig und liebt die **Sanftmut** in allen Angelegenheiten.","source":"Ṣaḥīḥ al-Buḫārī und Ṣaḥīḥ Muslim","grade":"Ṣaḥīḥ","verificationNote":"100er-Schritt 1251–1350; 20er-Ḥadīṯ-Unterblock."}